Package: com.aronsz26.lockscreenrestore
Name: LockScreenRestore
Version: 1.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: iOS 15 style lock screen on iOS 16: clock, date, padlock, Focus pill, notifications from the top, live wallpapers with Light/Dark switching. Each part can be switched off in Settings.
Maintainer: aronsz26
Author: aronsz26
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 16.0), preferenceloader
